    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty Off Road is inspired by early 2000s Offroading games. Put some relaxing music in the background, complete trails to earn money, customize and tune your vehicles for better performance, and ride together with people in massive open worlds.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Immerse yourself in the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/74a6632ba56eec3689e3aa83a3466520.poster.avif?t=1750285077\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/74a6632ba56eec3689e3aa83a3466520.webm?t=1750285077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/74a6632ba56eec3689e3aa83a3466520.mp4?t=1750285077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Large Maps full of events are sure to give you plenty of open world to explore</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Enjoy your OffRoading by yourself or together</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/b6e1aba4ff87e094a61deb2659ce6975.poster.avif?t=1750285077\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/b6e1aba4ff87e094a61deb2659ce6975.webm?t=1750285077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/b6e1aba4ff87e094a61deb2659ce6975.mp4?t=1750285077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends or make new ones! Each lobby holds up to 16 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in\u00a0Trail, Rally, Race, and Hill Climb event types</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's something for everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/09cc2b8136e537f84e36a837b5dcbff3.poster.avif?t=1750285077\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/09cc2b8136e537f84e36a837b5dcbff3.webm?t=1750285077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/09cc2b8136e537f84e36a837b5dcbff3.mp4?t=1750285077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty Off Road has everything from ATV's, UTVs, SUVs, Pickup Trucks, Crawler, Diesels, and Electrics. Every vehicle has strengths and weaknesses. Will you buy an all around jack of all trades, or buy specialized vehicles for each type of event?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fulfil your Offroading roleplay fantasies!</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/eece28f5e7aef138f3ee024f2557ec2e.poster.avif?t=1750285077\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/eece28f5e7aef138f3ee024f2557ec2e.webm?t=1750285077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147960/extras/eece28f5e7aef138f3ee024f2557ec2e.mp4?t=1750285077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension and Tire Tuning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles get dirty as you drive them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent Fuel Simulation Across Sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine Temperature Simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty Off Road is an early access work in progress that will evolve along with the community.</p>",
