s=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent Fuel Simulation Across Sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine Temperature Simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty Off Road is an early access work in progress that will evolve along with the community.</p>",
